        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter Settings**.\n2. Upload a short clip of one speaker in **Load Audio**. The clip is also the voice sample, so use your own voice or one you have permission to copy.\n3. Press **Run**. The dub is saved under `dub/approved` or `dub/review`, and the subtitles under `dub/subtitles`."
      ],
